Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.30,0:00:32.60,Title,0,0,0,0,,《功夫熊猫》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,传奇故事传颂着一名传奇大侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legend tells of a legendary warrior…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的功夫出神入化\N{\fnArial\fs30}…whose kung fu skills were the stuff of legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.51,0:00:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走遍天涯 独孤求败\N{\fnArial\fs30}He traveled the land in search of worthy foes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你挺喜欢吃啊 有种吃我一拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you like to chew. Maybe you should chew on my fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.69,0:01:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,大侠一言不发 因为吃了个满嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}The warrior said nothing for his mouth was full.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.30,0:01:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一口吞下 这才开口道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he swallowed. And then he spoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.53,0:01:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,「少废话 接招吧！」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough talk. Let's fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.90,0:01:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿命来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shashabooey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.31,0:01:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的一招一式如此彪悍\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was so deadly in fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的敌人目不暇接 瞠目结舌\N{\fnArial\fs30}that his enemies would go blind from overexposure to pure awesomeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的眼睛啊！- 他太彪悍啦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My eyes! - He's too awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.25,0:01:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太迷人了！- 我们何以回报？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And attractive. - How can we repay you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.85,0:01:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,彪悍不求回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no charge for awesomeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.32,0:01:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,迷人更无所需\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or attractiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.02,0:01:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,出事了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kablooey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.36,0:01:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他征战无数\N{\fnArial\fs30}It mattered not how many foes he faced.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.16,0:01:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,无人匹敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were no match for his bodacity!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:02:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没有哪只熊猫能让人如此畏惧 又让人如此爱戴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never before had a panda been so feared! And so loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.08,0:02:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是神州大地之上最英勇的勇士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the most heroic heroes in China,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.85,0:02:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,「盖世五侠」\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Furious Five,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.15,0:02:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,也心怀敬意地拜倒在这位大师脚下\N{\fnArial\fs30}bowed in respect to this great master.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.16,0:02:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一块儿出去玩玩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should hang out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.06,0:02:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.03,0:02:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但出去玩的事情得先放一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}But hanging out would have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.26,0:02:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为当你眼前是恶魔山的万千暴徒时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because when you're facing the 10, 000 demons of Demon Mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.77,0:02:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,正经事只有一件 那就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's only one thing that matters and that's…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.80,0:02:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿宝 快起床！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po! Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.47,0:02:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,要误生意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be later for work!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.31,0:02:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.08,0:02:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿宝 快起床！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po! Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.70,0:02:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿宝 你磨蹭啥呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po. What are you doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.24,0:02:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.04,0:03:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,金猴、螳螂、仙鹤、灵蛇、娇虎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkey! Mantis! Orane! Viper! Tigress!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.25,0:03:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿宝 快点 都误生意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po! Let's go! You're late for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.59,0:03:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.37,0:03:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.57,0:03:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起可变不出面条来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry doesn't make the noodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.47,0:03:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在楼上搞什么名堂 稀里哗啦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you doing up there? All that noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.91,0:03:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 就是个乱七八糟的梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. I just had a crazy dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.48,0:03:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么梦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.78,0:03:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦到什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you dreaming about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.45,0:03:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦到了…我梦见了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was I…?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.81,0:03:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我梦见了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was dreaming about…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.85,0:03:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,面条\N{\fnArial\fs30}…noodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.32,0:03:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,面条？你真梦见面条了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noodles? You were really dreaming about noodles?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.06,0:03:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 不然还能梦见啥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. What else would I be dreaming about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.69,0:03:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 汤很锋利哦（有飞镖）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful! That soup is sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.23,0:03:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 太让人高兴了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, happy day!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.76,0:04:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子终于做了个面条梦了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son, finally having the noodle dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.07,0:04:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你不知道 我等这一刻都等了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know how long I've been waiting for this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.14,0:04:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个好兆头 阿宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a sign, Po.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.08,0:04:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么好兆头\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sign of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.94,0:04:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于可以把我的秘之又秘\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are almost ready to be entrusted with the secret ingredient.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.65,0:04:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,私酿密汤的配方传给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}of my Secret Ingredient Soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.98,0:04:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样你就能不辱使命 继承这间饭馆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you will fulfill your destiny and take over the restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.19,0:04:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我子承父业 父承爷业一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I took it over from my father who took it over from his father…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.76,0:04:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这店可是爷爷打麻将从朋友手里赢来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who won it from a friend in mahjong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.50,0:04:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸 老爸 这不过是场梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, Dad, Dad, it was just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.27,0:04:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这是启示之梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it was the dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.63,0:04:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可是面条世家 连血管里都流着面汤\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are noodle folk. Broth runs through our veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.27,0:04:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 老爸 你有没有…想过做点别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Dad, didn't you ever want to do something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.24,0:04:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了面条之外的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something besides noodles?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.18,0:04:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我年少轻狂的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, when I was young and crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾想过 离家出走 学做豆腐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought about running away and learning how to make tofu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.32,0:04:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你干吗不做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.52,0:04:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是个黄梁蠢梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it was a stupid dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.05,0:04:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能想象我做豆腐的样子吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you imagine me making tofu?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.29,0:05:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,豆腐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tofu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.06,0:05:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别提了！我们各有其命\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! We all have our place in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.53,0:05:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的命就是在这儿煮面 而你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine is here, and yours is…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.17,0:05:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 也是在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.47,0:05:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,错！是送2号桌 5号桌 7号桌 还有12号桌\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's at tables 2, 5, 7, and 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.67,0:05:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了微笑服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Service with a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.04,0:05:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 徒弟们 要想不让我失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, students… if you were trying to disappoint me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.41,0:05:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,娇虎 力道要更强 金猴 速度要更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tigress, you need more ferocity! Monkey, greater speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.64,0:05:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,仙鹤 凌空要更高 灵蛇 出招要更敏锐 螳螂…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orane, height. Viper, subtlety. Mantis…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.61,0:05:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 师父 - 插什么嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Master Shifu. - What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.51,0:05:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌龟大师 他想见您\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Master Oogway. He wants to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.86,0:06:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌龟大师 您召见我 是出什么事了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Oogway, you summoned me? Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.64,0:06:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何非要出事 才能与老友相聚呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why must something be wrong for me to want to see my old friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.14,0:06:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说 没出啥事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, nothing's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.34,0:06:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不能说没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I didn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.43,0:06:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,您是想说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.80,0:06:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见一些幻相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have had a vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.94,0:06:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,太郞会重现江湖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tai Lung will return.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.61,0:07:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能 他还在牢里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is impossible! He is in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.25,0:07:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切皆有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.88,0:07:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,小曾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeng!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.95,0:07:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上飞到桃岗天牢去告诉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fly to Ohorh-Gom prison and tell them,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.35,0:07:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,看守加倍 兵器加倍 统统都加倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}to double the guards, double their weapons, double everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.76,0:07:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不能让大龙逃出大牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tai Lung does not leave that prison!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.73,0:07:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命！师父大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Master Shifu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.03,0:07:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,古语有云 子欲避之 反促遇之\N{\fnArial\fs30}One often meets his destiny on the road he takes to avoid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.27,0:07:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能无动于衷 我们不能让他闯入谷中泄愤\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must do something! We can't let him march on the valley and take his revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.34,0:07:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.41,0:07:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心如此水 我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mind is like this water my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.78,0:07:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,乱则不明\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it is agitated it becomes difficult to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.11,0:07:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但若心如止水\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you allow it to settle…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.78,0:07:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案便尽现眼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the answer becomes clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.79,0:07:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,神龙卷轴\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dragon Scroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.42,0:07:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.06,0:07:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可传给谁？谁值得信任 能把这无限的力量交付与他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But who? Who is worthy to be trusted with the secret to limitless power?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.86,0:07:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他成为「神龙大侠」\N{\fnArial\fs30}To become the Dragon Warrior?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.67,0:07:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.81,0:08:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Pardon me. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.81,0:08:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 看着点走 阿宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.91,0:08:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 收腹！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Suck it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.85,0:08:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 一千个抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. A thousand pardons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.65,0:08:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.75,0:08:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌龟大师要选神龙大侠！就在今天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Oogway's choosing the Dragon Warrior! Today!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.09,0:08:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙们 快去翡翠宫 五侠之一要得到神龙卷轴了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone! Get to the Jade Palace! One of the Five is gonna get the Dragon Scroll!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.76,0:08:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,千年等一回啊！碗上端快去啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've waited 1, 000 years for this! Take the bowl!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.90,0:08:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是功夫史上最重要的一天 别操心付账了 快去吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the greatest day in kung fu history! Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.10,0:08:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿宝 你要去哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po! Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.00,0:08:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,去翡翠宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the Jade Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.41,0:08:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你忘了你的面条车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're forgetting your noodle cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.77,0:08:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个山谷的人都会去 你可以大卖特卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole valley will be there and you'll sell noodles to all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.41,0:08:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,卖面条？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Selling noodles?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 老爸 我在想我可不可以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Dad, I was thinking, maybe I…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.99,0:08:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我在想我可不可以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - I was thinking maybe I…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.96,0:08:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不可以也顺道卖点豆包 省的放坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…could also sell the bean buns. They're about to go bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.60,0:08:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.40,0:09:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过那个梦是个好兆头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you that dream was a sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.67,0:09:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哈 真高兴我做了这个梦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Glad I had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.84,0:09:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是功夫大侠 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm a kung fu warrior! - Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.31,0:09:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 山都连上天了 - 咱快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's spots at the top. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.35,0:09:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,加把劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.18,0:09:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.12,0:09:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.35,0:09:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.36,0:10:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 阿宝 - 我们会给你带纪念品的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, Po. - We'll bring you back a souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.37,0:10:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要自己带纪念品下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'll bring me back a souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.08,0:10:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是历史性的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is an historic day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.54,0:10:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧 乌龟大师？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it, Master Oogway?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.38,0:10:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我还怕我不能活着等到这天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and one I feared I would not live to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.32,0:10:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的徒弟们准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are your students ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.39,0:10:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 乌龟大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Master Oogway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.32,0:10:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,老朋友 你得明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know this, old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.12,0:10:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我选了谁 不仅是给山谷带来平和\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whomever I choose will not only bring peace to the valley…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.53,0:10:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but also to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.87,0:10:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,比武大会现在开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the tournament begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.08,0:10:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.95,0:11:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.25,0:11:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了！等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming! Wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.66,0:11:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.89,0:11:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 把门开开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.17,0:11:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我进去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.34,0:11:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,平和谷的居民们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oitizens of the Valley of Peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.97,0:11:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我深感荣幸 为你们介绍 娇虎\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is my great honor to present to you… Tigress!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵蛇 仙鹤 金猴 螳螂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Viper! Orane! Monkey! Mantis!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.98,0:11:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,「盖世五侠」\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Furious Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.09,0:11:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！盖世五侠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the Furious Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.86,0:11:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,大侠们准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warriors, prepare!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.27,0:11:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 不 噢 门孔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. No. Oh, peeky-hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.90,0:11:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备比武 - 耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready for battle! - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.30,0:11:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,数千火舌\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Thousand Tongues of Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.61,0:11:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇噢 看看那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.81,0:11:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 别挡着我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.95,0:12:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后出场的是 娇虎大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}And finally Master Tigress!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.78,0:12:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 居民们 你们将大开眼界\N{\fnArial\fs30}And believe me, citizens you have not seen anything yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.25,0:12:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.59,0:12:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,娇虎上场 为您表演 大战钢铁牛和他的绝命刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Tigress! Face Iron OX and his Blades of Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.11,0:13:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉到「神龙大侠」就在我们中间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sense the Dragon Warrior is among us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.68,0:13:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,平和谷的居民们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oitizens of the Valley of Peace,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.79,0:13:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌龟大师现在要选出「神龙大侠」了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Oogway will now choose the Dragon Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.29,0:13:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？不不 等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! No, no, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.73,0:13:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.75,0:13:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.85,0:13:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.85,0:13:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我在干什么？别…别吹！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it look like I'm doing?! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.49,0:13:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去看「神龙大侠」！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to see the Dragon Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.72,0:13:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我不懂 你才做了面条梦啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't understand. You finally had the noodle dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.73,0:13:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我骗你的 老爸 我没梦见面条\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lied. I don't dream about noodles, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.57,0:14:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱功夫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love kung fu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.25,0:14:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧 儿子 还是回家卖面吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, son. Let's get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.72,0:14:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.20,0:14:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.19,0:15:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.76,0:15:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where…?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.93,0:15:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you pointing…?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.24,0:15:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.30,0:15:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想看看谁才是「神龙大侠」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to see who the Dragon Warrior was.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.84,0:15:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有意思啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.84,0:15:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,大师 您是指我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master, are you pointing at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.21,0:15:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他 - 谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Him. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.28,0:15:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你 - 我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You. - Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.52,0:15:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,上苍降「神龙大侠」给我们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The universe has brought us the Dragon Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.26,0:15:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 什么？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.76,0:15:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？！- 什么？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?! - What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.34,0:15:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下！等等！谁叫你们去的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop, wait! Who told you to…?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.72,0:15:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌龟大师 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Oogway, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.05,0:16:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只又肥又胖的熊猫怎么可能是神龙大侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}That flabby panda can't possibly be the answer to our problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.32,0:16:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正要指娇虎的时候 那只破烂熊猫从天而降\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were about to point at Tigress and that thing fell in front of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.13,0:16:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这纯属意外！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was just an accident!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.63,0:16:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上无意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no accidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.51,0:16:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,请您原谅 师父 我们让您失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive us, Master. We have failed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.35,0:16:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 要是明天那熊猫还没打退堂鼓\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. If the panda has not quit by morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.75,0:16:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我让你们失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I will have failed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.37,0:16:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下！我是来送信的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Wait, wait, wait! I bring a message…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.17,0:16:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,替师父大师而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…from Master Shifu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.18,0:17:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.35,0:17:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,守卫加倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Double the guard?!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.75,0:17:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,警戒加倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Extra precautions?!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.62,0:17:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的天牢还不够严密\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Your prison may not be adequate?!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.06,0:17:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怀疑我天牢的安全？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You doubt my prison security?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.60,0:17:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.53,0:17:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,师父这么说 我就是个传话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shifu does. I'm just the messenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.73,0:17:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么请你代我传个话给师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you a message for your Master Shifu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.00,0:17:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,从桃岗天牢越狱 绝无可能！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Escape from Ohorh-Gom prison is impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.38,0:17:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,叹为观止吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lmpressive, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.28,0:17:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 是 叹为观止\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.15,0:17:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,相当的叹为观止\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.72,0:17:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,进道出路 只有一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}One way in, one way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.46,0:17:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,千名守卫 只为一囚\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thousand guards and one prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.63,0:17:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 只是那个囚徒是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, except that prisoner…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.23,0:17:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,大龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is Tai Lung.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.00,0:17:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,送我们下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.24,0:18:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.95,0:18:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我的天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.69,0:18:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看 这就是大龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold Tai Lung.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.43,0:18:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我还是待在这儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna wait right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.57,0:18:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么好担心的 万无一失\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing to worry about. It's perfectly safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.94,0:18:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,弩弓待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orossbows! At the ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.27,0:18:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,弩弓？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orossbows?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.14,0:18:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 牛人 你听说了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, tough guy, did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.78,0:18:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌龟要把神龙卷轴传人了 别想了 反正不会是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oogway's giving someone the Dragon Scroll, and it's not gonna be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.35,0:18:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把他惹恼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get him mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.09,0:18:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又能怎么着 我已经把他捆结实了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he gonna do about it? I've got him completely immobilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.13,0:19:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 我是不是踩到小猫咪的尾巴了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I step on the wittle kitty's tail?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.20,0:19:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 我看够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good. I've seen enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.03,0:19:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会跟师父说没啥可担心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell Shifu he has nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.54,0:19:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.84,0:19:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell him that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.14,0:19:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们能走了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we please go now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.59,0:19:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,神龙大侠！神龙大侠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dragon Warrior! Dragon Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.49,0:19:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,神龙大侠！神龙大侠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dragon Warrior! Dragon Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.73,0:19:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.17,0:19:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这是个小误会 大家都以为我是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think there's been a slight mistake. Everyone seems to think that I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.78,0:19:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇侠圣殿！不会吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Sacred Hall of Warriors! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.08,0:19:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这地儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.69,0:20:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞天犀牛大师的盔甲 还有货真价实的战斗破损！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Flying Rhino's armor with authentic battle damage!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.40,0:20:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,英雄之刃！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Sword of Heroes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.13,0:20:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说吹毛断发 看看都会受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said to be so sharp you can cut yourself just by looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.44,0:20:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐形的命运之杖！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Invisible Trident of Destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.77,0:20:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只见过这画的临摹版\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've only seen paintings of that painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.25,0:20:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.15,0:20:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说中的英灵窃语之瓮\N{\fnArial\fs30}The legendary Urn of Whispering Warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.99,0:20:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说里面有整个天书军团的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said to contain the souls of the entire Tenshu Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.53,0:20:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.73,0:20:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你观光完毕了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you finished sight-seeing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.13,0:20:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我该先来看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I should have come to you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.30,0:20:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的耐心有限\N{\fnArial\fs30}My patience is wearing thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.34,0:20:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 看起来你也没法去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean, it's not like you were going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.24,0:20:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能转过身来吗？- 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you turn around? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.67,0:20:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 这样怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.78,0:20:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么让五千… 师父大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you get 5, 000… Master Shifu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.81,0:20:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人把这个打碎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone… broke that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.65,0:21:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我会把它黏好的 你有没有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll fix it. Do you have some…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.99,0:21:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,…胶水？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…glue?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.19,0:21:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，扎手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A splinter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.26,0:21:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是那个传说中的「神龙大侠」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're the legendary Dragon Warrior?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.33,0:21:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想是吧 - 错！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I guess so. - Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.53,0:21:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是也不可能是神龙大侠 除非\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not the Dragon Warrior. You will never be the Dragon Warrior until…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.33,0:21:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你掌握了神龙卷轴里的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you have learned the secret of the Dragon Scroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.47,0:21:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我怎么上去呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how does this work?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.98,0:21:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有梯子或者蹦床或者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a ladder or a trampoline, or…?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.21,0:21:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想的太简单了 我会把那无限力量的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it's that easy? That I'll just hand you the secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.32,0:21:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这么交给你？- 不是的 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- to limitless power? - No, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.29,0:21:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人必须先达到功夫的最高境界\N{\fnArial\fs30}One must first master the highest level of kung fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.39,0:21:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,而像你这样的是不可能了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is impossible if that one is someone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.53,0:21:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.63,0:21:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 瞧瞧你 这肥臀 这肥胳膊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, look at you! This fat butt! Flabby arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.37,0:21:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 这些赘肉可都娇贵的很呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are sensitive in the flabby parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.90,0:21:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这滑天下之大稽的大肚皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this ridiculous belly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.80,0:21:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 一点儿也不讲卫生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And utter disregard for personal hygiene.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.14,0:21:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着 这么说可有点过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, wait a minute. That's uncalled for.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.38,0:22:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别站这么近 口臭都出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't stand that close. I can smell your breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.01,0:22:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 乌龟大师说我是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Oogway said I was…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.91,0:22:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 巫师指 别用巫师指\N{\fnArial\fs30}The WuXi Finger Hold. Not the WuXi Finger Hold!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.68,0:22:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你知道这个指法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you know this hold?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.49,0:22:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三王朝时 巫师大师发明的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Developed by Master WuXi in the Third Dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.22,0:22:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你一定知道 一旦弯下小指会发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you know what happens when I fleX my pinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.86,0:22:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别 千万别 - 你知道最难办的是什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no! - You know the hardest part of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.60,0:22:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是清理你的尸骨残骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hardest part is cleaning up afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.53,0:22:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 没错 别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, OK, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.74,0:22:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那仔细听着 熊猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now listen closely, panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.24,0:22:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌龟大师也许选了你 可当我找上你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oogway may have picked you, but when I'm through with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.44,0:22:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证 你会希望 他选的不是你！清楚了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you, you're going to wish he hadn't! Are we clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.51,0:22:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,清楚了 一清二楚 十分清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're clear. We're so clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.72,0:22:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 呵呵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.52,0:22:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都等不及要开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait to get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.06,0:23:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开始吧 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's begin. - Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.63,0:23:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.50,0:23:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在吗？- 就现在！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now? - Yes, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.03,0:23:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你认为了不起的乌龟大师错了 而你也不是「神龙大侠」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless the great Oogway was wrong and you are not the Dragon Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.41,0:23:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, OK, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.04,0:23:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我能不能… 把那些招式都比划出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if I can do all of those moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.11,0:23:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不试试 又怎么能知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if we don't try we'll never know, will we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.95,0:23:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但能不能从更合适我这个级别的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's just, maybe we can find something more suited to my level.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.85,0:23:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你的级别又是什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What level is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.99,0:23:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道…我不是大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not a master, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.52,0:23:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如从零级开始 零级\N{\fnArial\fs30}…let's just start at zero. Level zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.36,0:23:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 从来没有零级的说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. There is no such thing as level zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.53,0:24:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 也许我可以从那开始 - 那个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe I can start with that. - That?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.40,0:24:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用来训练孩子 天热的时候还用来顶门\N{\fnArial\fs30}We use that for training children and propping the door open when it's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.50,0:24:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,可要是你坚持的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you insist…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.94,0:24:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 是「盖世五侠」！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Furious Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.77,0:24:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可比功夫公仔大多了 除了你 螳螂 你还是那么大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bigger than your action figures. EXcept, you, Mantis. You're the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.32,0:24:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始吧 熊猫 让我们看看你的能耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, panda. Show us what you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.75,0:24:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就在这看我打？还是我应该等你们都回去再开始…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they gonna watch, or should I wait till they get back to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.19,0:24:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,出招\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.29,0:24:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我刚吃完东西 还在消化\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, yeah. I mean, I just ate. So I'm still digesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.00,0:24:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我的功夫可能不像过一会儿那么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So my kung fu might not be as good as… later on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.83,0:24:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出招！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.80,0:24:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.90,0:24:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你算老几啊？有我在这儿你啥都不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you got? You got nothing 'cause I got it right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.37,0:24:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找我朋友的茬？准备受死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You picking on my friends? Get ready to feel thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.48,0:24:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我佛山无影脚 你没辙了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming at you with crazy feet. What you gonna do about crazy feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.75,0:24:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 给你来个移形幻影 没见识过熊猫功夫吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. I'm a blur. You've never seen bear style.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.82,0:24:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就知道螳臂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've only seen praying mantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.68,0:24:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,猴拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or monkey style.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.29,0:24:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还会金蛇狂舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I could come at you snickety-snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.69,0:25:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能出招吗？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you hit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.16,0:25:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.00,0:25:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次 重点儿打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you try again? A little harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.84,0:25:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样…啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.88,0:25:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,疼死我了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.39,0:25:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这比我想得可简单多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will be easier than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.63,0:25:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感到有点想吐！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm feeling a little nauseous!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.96,0:25:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么硬！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.64,0:25:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的命根子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My tenders.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.17,0:26:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我表现如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.93,0:26:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,算得上零级了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is now a level zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.80,0:26:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 简直无语 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's no words. - No denying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.27,0:26:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不懂乌龟大师怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was Master Oogway thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.68,0:26:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可怜的孩子 差点把自己弄死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The poor guy's gonna get himself killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.05,0:26:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他太「无敌」了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is so mighty!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.61,0:26:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,「神龙大侠」坐在火球上从天而降！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dragon Warrior fell out of the sky on a ball of fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.52,0:26:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,举手投足 地动山摇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he walks, the very ground shakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.36,0:26:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,本以为乌龟大师会选一个会功夫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}One would think Master Oogway would choose someone who knew kung fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.69,0:26:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 起码是一个能够到脚趾头的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, or could at least touch his toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.80,0:26:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少也要能看到自己的脚趾头吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or even see his toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.56,0:27:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错 都睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.53,0:27:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.02,0:27:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 你醒啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. You're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.68,0:27:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.25,0:27:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.72,0:27:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不简单的一天哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some day, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.69,0:27:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,功夫可够累人的哈 你肱二头肌酸不酸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kung fu stuff is hard work, right? Are your biceps sore?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.13,0:27:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天已经是又长又失望的一天了 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had a long and rather disappointing day, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.67,0:27:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差不多也该睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I should probably get to sleep now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.10,0:28:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对对 当然 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, yeah, yeah. Of course. - OK, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.57,0:28:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是… 我可是你们的超级粉丝哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just… Man, I'm such a big fan!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.51,0:28:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,泣河一战 你们实在太牛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys were amazing at the Battle of Weeping River.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.28,0:28:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们以一挡千 你们毫无惧意 你们如同…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outnumbered a thousand to one but you didn't stop. You just…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.55,0:28:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.95,0:28:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你不属于这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you don't belong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.16,0:28:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 我知道 说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I know. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.13,0:28:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没啥… 我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have… I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.70,0:28:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一生都梦想着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My whole life I dreamed of…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.30,0:28:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我指你不属于「这儿」 我指这个房间 这是我的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I meant you don't belong here. I mean, in this room. This is my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.54,0:28:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,仙鹤产权所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Property of Orane.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.67,0:28:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 确实 确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.61,0:28:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…你想睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you want to get to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.21,0:28:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 我妨碍你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - I'm keeping you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.08,0:28:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天还有要事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got big things tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.28,0:28:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你很彪悍！我就说这么多 拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. You're awesome. Last thing I'm gonna say. Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.32,0:28:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.56,0:28:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.06,0:28:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. All right. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.30,0:28:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好梦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep well.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.30,0:29:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似有点尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}That seemed a little awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.14,0:29:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,娇虎大师！没想吵醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Tigress! I didn't mean to wake you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.71,0:29:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不属于这里！- 是的 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't belong here. - Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.48,0:29:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.84,0:29:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 你不配待在翡翠宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you don't belong in the Jade Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.21,0:29:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让功夫蒙羞\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a disgrace to kung fu,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.65,0:29:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你对我们 还有我们的事业存有敬重\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if you have any respect for who we are and what we do,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.62,0:29:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,明早前 你就该走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will be gone by morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.23,0:29:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,超级粉丝哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big fan!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.27,0:29:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你找到了圣智桃树啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you have found the Sacred Peach Tree of Heavenly Wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.44,0:29:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是？抱歉我以为它就是棵普通桃树\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what this is? Sorry. I thought it was just a regular peach tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.21,0:29:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能理解 你不开心的时候就会吃东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand. You eat when you are upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.22,0:29:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不开心？我没不开心啊 什么让你认为我不开心了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upset? I'm not upset. What makes you think I'm upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.49,0:30:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么不开心呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why are you so upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.03,0:30:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能是功夫史上最烂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I probably sucked more today than anyone in the history of kung fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.64,0:30:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国史上最烂的 烂人史上也是最烂的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the history of China. In the history of sucking!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.34,0:30:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.51,0:30:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看「盖世五侠」！你该看看 他们对我恨之入骨啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Five! Man, you should've seen them! They totally hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.28,0:30:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不假\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.34,0:30:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,师父怎么可能把我变成「神龙大侠」啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is Shifu ever going to turn me into the Dragon Warrior?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.55,0:30:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一点也不像「五侠」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm not like the Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.52,0:30:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没爪子 没翅膀 也没毒牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got no claws, no wings, no venom.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.16,0:30:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就连螳螂 也有那些…镰刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even Mantis has those… thingies.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.69,0:30:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉 也许我就该一走了之 回家煮面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I should just quit and go back to making noodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.27,0:30:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家？不回家？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit, don't quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.50,0:30:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,煮面？不煮面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noodles, don't noodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.61,0:30:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太在意过去曾怎样 将来会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are too concerned with what was and what will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.35,0:30:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有句谚语说得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a saying:
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.28,0:30:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天已是历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday is history,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.82,0:31:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天还很神秘\N{\fnArial\fs30}tomorrow is a mystery,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.29,0:31:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是今天是一个礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}but today is a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.49,0:31:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么要把它叫做「当下」\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is why it is called the present.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.29,0:31:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 不会吧 - 发生什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no! - What's happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.72,0:31:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的战斗位置 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}To your battle stations! Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.97,0:31:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,弩弓发射！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire crossbows!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.67,0:31:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.64,0:31:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.32,0:32:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,大龙越狱了！我必须去警告师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tai Lung is free! I must warn Shifu.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.09,0:32:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你哪也去不了！他也一样！- 放开我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not going anywhere! Neither is he! - Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.99,0:32:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它拉起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.86,0:32:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 先放下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Bring it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.15,0:32:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他朝这来了 - 他过不来的 弓箭手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's coming this way! - He won't get far. Archers!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.88,0:33:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们死翘翘了 死得很翘很翘了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dead. So very, very dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.82,0:33:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没呢 至少现在还没！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet we're not. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.57,0:34:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在能跑了么 - 能了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can we run now? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.13,0:35:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴师父派你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad Shifu sent you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.80,0:35:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为都把我忘了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was beginning to think I'd been forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.70,0:35:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞回去跟他们说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fly back there and tell them…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.80,0:35:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的「神龙大侠」 要回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the real Dragon Warrior is coming home.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.52,0:35:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.52,0:35:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,熊猫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Panda!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.22,0:35:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,熊猫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Panda!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.59,0:35:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,起床！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.33,0:35:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他果然走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.57,0:35:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在做什么 熊猫走了 谁会成为「神龙大侠」呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do now, with the panda gone? Who will be the Dragon Warrior?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.71,0:35:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能做的 就是勤加练习 假以时日\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we can do is resume our training and trust that in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.88,0:35:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的「神龙大侠」便会脱颖而出\N{\fnArial\fs30}the true Dragon Warrior will be revealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.01,0:35:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.48,0:35:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi! Good morning, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.58,0:36:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想先热热身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I'd warm up a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.59,0:36:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你卡住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.66,0:36:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡住了？什么 哪有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuck? Nah. What? Stuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.03,0:36:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我只是在… 好吧 我卡住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah. This is one of my… Yeah, I'm stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.90,0:36:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去帮他 - 受不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help him. - Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.96,0:36:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数到三！一 二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe on three. One, two…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.50,0:36:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,…三\N{\fnArial\fs30}…three.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.47,0:36:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 别提这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.21,0:36:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我真的很感激… - 永远别提！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, really, I appreciate… - Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.21,0:36:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为你能一夜练成劈叉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You actually thought you could learn to do a full split in one night?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.58,0:36:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是数年苦练 才习得的柔韧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It takes years to develop one's flexibility!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.02,0:36:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,再加以数载 才能用于实战\N{\fnArial\fs30}And years longer to apply it in combat!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.20,0:36:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,把-那-放-下-来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put that down!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.80,0:36:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们收集的纪念品 只会是残肢断臂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only souvenirs we collect here are bloody knuckles and broken bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.37,0:36:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷 棒极了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! EXcellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.11,0:36:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.61,0:37:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你准备好了吗？- 我打小就准备…啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you ready? - I was born re…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.45,0:37:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不好意思 我以为你说的是你早已准备好了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, brother. I thought you said you were ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.52,0:37:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太酷了 再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was awesome! Let's go again!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.18,0:37:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都对你手下留情 熊猫 但到此为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been taking it easy on you, panda. But no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.18,0:37:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你下一个对手 就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your next opponent will be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.59,0:37:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! Yeah, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.86,0:37:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,上前一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.99,0:37:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,取胜的两个诀窍就是 找到对手的软肋\N{\fnArial\fs30}The true path to victory is to find your opponent's weakness…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.53,0:37:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,并让他痛不欲生\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and make him suffer for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.46,0:37:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.87,0:37:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,借力打力\N{\fnArial\fs30}To take his strength and use it against him…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.30,0:38:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到他倒地不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}…until he finally falls…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.90,0:38:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,或求饶认输\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or quits.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.94,0:38:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的大侠绝不言弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}A real warrior never quits.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.01,0:38:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 大师 我永远不会放弃的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Master. I will never quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.59,0:38:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他够聪明 他不会再爬上来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's smart he won't come back up those steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.86,0:38:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他会上来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he will.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.26,0:38:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会放弃的 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not going to quit, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.63,0:38:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能告诉你的是 他不会放弃弹跳的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not going to quit bouncing I'll tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.28,0:38:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你说针灸会让我好受些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said acupuncture would make me feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.41,0:38:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.51,0:38:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是不容易找准你的穴位 都是些…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just not easy finding the right nerve points under all this…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.22,0:38:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 脂肪？- 毛皮 我是想说毛皮的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fat? - Fur. I was going to say fur.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.95,0:38:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,才怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.02,0:38:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会用体型来评价一个大侠 看看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who am I to judge a warrior based on his size? Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.26,0:38:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.36,0:39:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你得再看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should look at this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.90,0:39:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.10,0:39:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 住手…啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.27,0:39:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道师父大师是在激励我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know Master Shifu is trying to inspire me and all…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.54,0:39:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是我了解他 我还以为他是想撵我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but if I didn't know better I'd say he was trying to get rid of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.15,0:39:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他看上去有点无情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know he can seem kind of heartless…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.19,0:39:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他原本不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but he wasn't always like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.22,0:39:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.62,0:39:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前 师父也曾笑口常开\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was once a time when Master Shifu actually used to smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.23,0:39:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不可能 - 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.23,0:39:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是在…之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that was before.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.57,0:39:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在什么之前？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.63,0:39:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在大龙之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before Tai Lung.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.07,0:39:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不该提起他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not really supposed to talk about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.71,0:39:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他打算留下 就该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if he's going to stay here he should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.78,0:39:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 各位 我知道大龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, guys, I know about Tai Lung.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.78,0:39:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是有史以来第一个 学会了师父千般武艺的徒弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a student. The first ever to master the thousand scrolls of kung fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.32,0:39:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他变坏了 再然后…就蹲大牢了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then he turned bad and now he's in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.55,0:39:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不只是个徒弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn'tjust a student.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.03,0:40:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,师父捡到他时 他还在襁褓之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shifu found him as a cub…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.50,0:40:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,师父抚养他长大 视同己出\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and he raised him as his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.80,0:40:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,当发现那小子天生就是武学奇才时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when the boy showed talent in kung fu…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.97,0:40:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,师父倾其所能悉心教导\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Shifu trained him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.31,0:40:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,信任他 跟他说必成大器\N{\fnArial\fs30}He believed in him. He told him he was destined for greatness.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.15,0:40:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,大龙他永远不满足\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was never enough for Tai Lung.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.62,0:40:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想得到神龙卷轴\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted the Dragon Scroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.29,0:40:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,可乌龟大师洞察到了他心中的黑暗 拒绝传给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Oogway saw darkness in his heart and refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.93,0:40:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,盛怒之下 大龙血洗山谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outraged, Tai Lung laid waste to the valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.10,0:40:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他试图强行夺取卷轴\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to take the scroll by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.20,0:40:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,师父不得不斩除自己种下的祸根\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Shifu had to destroy what he had created.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.77,0:40:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他怎么忍心呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how could he?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.49,0:41:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,师父之前从没像爱大龙那样爱过别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shifu loved Tai Lung like he had never loved anyone before.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.90,0:41:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许 从那之后也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or since.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.65,0:41:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在他有机会 来拨乱返正\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now he has a chance to make things right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.58,0:41:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,训练真正的「神龙大侠」\N{\fnArial\fs30}To train the true Dragon Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.88,0:41:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,却碰到了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's stuck with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.99,0:41:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只又肥又胖视练武如儿戏的熊猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}A big fat panda who treats it like a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.76,0:41:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.83,0:41:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我的错！我不小心扎到了他的面部穴位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! My fault! I accidentally tweaked his facial nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.40,0:41:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像心脏也被扎停了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And may have also stopped his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.54,0:41:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,平心静气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inner peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.37,0:41:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,平心静气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inner peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.35,0:42:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,平心…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inner…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.65,0:42:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,平心静气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inner peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.52,0:42:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在呼扇呼扇的？给我安静！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would whoever is making that flapping sound quiet down?!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.30,0:42:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,平心…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inner…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.17,0:42:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 小曾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Zeng.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.30,0:42:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.97,0:42:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在正需要一些好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could use some good news right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.68,0:42:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,大师 大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master! Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.72,0:42:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一个… 一个… 很坏的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have… It's… It's very bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.05,0:42:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shifu.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.49,0:42:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,消息就是消息 没有好坏之分\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is just news. There is no good or bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.96,0:42:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,大师 你的幻相…你的幻相应验了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master, your vision. Your vision was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.70,0:42:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,大龙越狱了 他正在赶来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tai Lung has broken out of prison. He's on his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.57,0:43:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还真是坏消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is bad news…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.37,0:43:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不相信「神龙大侠」可以阻止他的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if you do not believe that the Dragon Warrior can stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.78,0:43:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只熊猫？大师 那熊猫可不是什么「神龙大侠」\N{\fnArial\fs30}The panda? Master that panda is not the Dragon Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.11,0:43:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他根本不该在这儿 那只是个巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't meant to be here! It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.48,0:43:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no accidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.02,0:43:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的我知道 你已经说过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know. You've said that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.22,0:43:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 两遍了 - 这也不是偶然.\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Twice. - Well, that was no accident, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.49,0:43:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,三遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thrice.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.66,0:43:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}My old friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.36,0:43:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿宝没法完成他的使命 你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}the panda will never fulfill his destiny, nor you yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.04,0:43:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非假象不再蒙蔽你的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}until you let go of the illusion of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.67,0:43:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,假象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Illusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.11,0:43:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 看看这棵树 师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Look at this tree, Shifu.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.18,0:43:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法强迫它随时开花\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot make it blossom when it suits me,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.28,0:43:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不能令它提前结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}nor make it bear fruit before its time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.62,0:43:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 有些事情我们可以控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there are things we can control.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.22,0:43:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以左右果子何时落地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can control when the fruit will fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.39,0:43:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还可以左右种子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can control…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.16,0:43:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,种于何地\N{\fnArial\fs30}…where to plant the seed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.66,0:44:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是假象 大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is no illusion, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.40,0:44:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.47,0:44:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便如此 无论你做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no matter what you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.94,0:44:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种子终会长成桃树\N{\fnArial\fs30}that seed will grow to be a peach tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.94,0:44:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也许想要苹果或是橘子 但你能得到的只能是桃子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may wish for an apple or an orange but you will get a peach.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.88,0:44:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是桃子不能打败大龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a peach cannot defeat Tai Lung!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.58,0:44:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许可以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it can.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.32,0:44:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你愿意对其谆谆教导\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are willing to guide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.19,0:44:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,悉心培养\N{\fnArial\fs30}To nurture it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.12,0:44:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,心存信念\N{\fnArial\fs30}To believe in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.59,0:44:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 得怎么做呢？要怎么做呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.13,0:44:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助 大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.16,0:44:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要 你只需要相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you just need to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.57,0:44:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我 师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise me, Shifu.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.47,0:44:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我你会相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise me you will believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.24,0:44:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…尽量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will try.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.64,0:44:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.31,0:44:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的时辰到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.59,0:44:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得孤身前行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must continue yourjourney without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.06,0:45:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什… 什…你说什么…等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you…? Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.86,0:45:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,大师！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.00,0:45:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要丢下我一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.33,0:45:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.91,0:45:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,大师！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.94,0:45:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓人吧？我说 就算你是豺狼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scary? Yeah, so I'm like "Fine, you may be a wolf,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.67,0:45:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是福建第一恶霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}you may be the scariest bandit in Haijin Province…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.94,0:45:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你给小费太小气啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but you're a lousy tipper."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.85,0:45:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？那你是怎么活着回来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? So how did you get out of there alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.65,0:46:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说… 我没有真的说出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I didn't actually say that…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.28,0:46:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是心里\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I thought it…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.82,0:46:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.65,0:46:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要是会读心术的话 一定会说：「大胆！」\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he could read my mind he'd be, like, "What?"
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.29,0:46:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,面来咯 希望你们会喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Order up! Hope you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.36,0:46:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 味道好极了 - 得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is really good! - No, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.67,0:46:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得尝尝我老爸的私酿密汤 只有他知道秘方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try my dad's Secret Ingredient Soup. He actually knows the secret ingredient.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.04,0:46:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么呢 这味道棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? This is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.51,0:46:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可真会煮 - 真希望嘴巴大一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're a really good cook. - I wish my mouth was bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.51,0:46:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,娇虎 快尝尝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tigress, you've got to try this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.48,0:46:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,相传「神龙大侠」单靠银杏甘露\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is said that the Dragon Warrior can survive for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.18,0:46:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,和日月精华 就能活好几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}on nothing but the dew of ginkgo leaf and the energy of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.35,0:46:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜我的身体还没意识到它成了「神龙大侠」呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess my body doesn't know it's the Dragon Warrior yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.32,0:46:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,光靠甘露和精华可没法活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need a lot more than dew and universe juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.73,0:46:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 笑啥？- 没啥 师父大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Nothing… Master Shifu.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.61,0:47:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远都成不了「神龙大侠」 除非你减500磅膘 刷干净牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never be the Dragon Warrior unless you lose 500 pounds and brush your teeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.88,0:47:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,吵什么吵？！笑声 我听都没听过\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that noise you're making? Laughter? I never heard of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.38,0:47:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,努力吧 熊猫 也许有一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work hard, panda, and maybe someday…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.29,0:47:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以拥有像我一样的耳朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you will have ears like mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.79,0:47:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真像\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.79,0:47:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,耳朵 不好笑吗？我觉得挺逗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ears. It's not working for you? I thought they were pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.53,0:47:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是师父！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Shifu!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.73,0:47:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是师父 不然你以为我在模仿谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it's Shifu. What do you think I'm doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.37,0:47:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢… 师父大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Shifu!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.00,0:47:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们觉得好笑吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this is funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.77,0:47:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,大龙越狱了 你们还跟个小孩子一样！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tai Lung has escaped and you're acting like children!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.81,0:47:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 他是冲着「神龙卷轴」来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - He is coming for the Dragon Scroll,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.18,0:47:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你是唯一可以阻止他的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you are the only one who can stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.22,0:47:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 我说的没错吧 你还真不懂幽默\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was saying you got no sense of humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.92,0:47:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我…阻止大龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna… stop Tai Lung.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.29,0:47:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥？！你当真？真要我去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You're serious? And I have to…?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.99,0:47:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌龟大师会阻止他的 就像他上次那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Oogway will stop him like he did before, he'll do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.03,0:47:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌龟不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oogway cannot!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.07,0:47:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不能了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.97,0:48:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们唯一的希望就只剩下「神龙大侠」了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our only hope is the Dragon Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.74,0:48:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 靠这熊猫？- 就靠这熊猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The panda? - Yes, the panda!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.44,0:48:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,师父 拜托 让我们来阻止大龙 这也是你教我们武功的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master, please, let us stop Tai Lung. This is what you've trained us for.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.11,0:48:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 打败大龙不是你的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! It is not your destiny to defeat Tai Lung.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.75,0:48:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是他的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is his!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.42,0:48:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.89,0:48:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可以走 真的大侠是永不言弃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot leave! A real warrior never quits.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.26,0:48:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.43,0:48:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.60,0:48:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我凭什么打败大龙 我连绕过你下山都做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I supposed to beat Tai Lung? I can't even beat you to the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.50,0:48:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以打败他 因为你是「神龙大侠」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will beat him because you are the Dragon Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.31,0:48:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不信这鬼话 你从没信过这鬼话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't believe that. You never believed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.64,0:48:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我初来乍到的时候 你不是想方设法把我踹走？\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the beginning you've tried to get rid of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.71,0:48:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 那是以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.12,0:48:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在 我要你相信你的师父 就像我相信我的师父那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I ask you to trust in your master as I have come to trust in mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.32,0:48:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是我师父 我也不是什么「神龙大侠」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not my master. And I'm not the Dragon Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.13,0:49:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么不放弃 你明知道我要赶你走 但你还是留下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why didn't you quit?! You knew I wanted you gone, yet you stayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.56,0:49:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我是留下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I stayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.63,0:49:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留下是因为 每次你往我头上拍砖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stayed because every time you threw a brick at my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.47,0:49:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者说我难闻 是会让我伤心 但这些都赶不上以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}or said I smelled, it hurt but it could never hurt more,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.94,0:49:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去天天浑浑噩噩 更让我伤心\N{\fnArial\fs30}than it did every day of my life just being me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.15,0:49:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留下 是因为我知道 要是还有人能改变我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stayed because I thought if anyone could change me…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.82,0:49:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以让我超越自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}…could make me… not me…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.95,0:49:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.55,0:49:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,全中国最了不起的功夫师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}The greatest kung fu teacher in all of China!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.59,0:49:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以改变你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can change you!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.26,0:49:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以让你成为「神龙大侠」 我会做到的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can turn you into the Dragon Warrior! And I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.86,0:49:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 大龙马上就要赶到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Tai Lung is on his way here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.93,0:49:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算他要在路上耗上一百年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if it takes him a hundred years to get here, how are you…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.40,0:49:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又怎么能把眼前这个肥仔训练成神龙大侠？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…gonna change this into the Dragon Warrior?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.98,0:49:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有办法吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.61,0:49:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.65,0:49:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有了吧？- 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How?! - I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.89,0:50:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.04,0:50:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.91,0:50:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,养兵千日 用兵一时\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you trained me for.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.22,0:51:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,娇虎！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tigress!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.46,0:51:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想拦我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't try and stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.00,0:51:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是要拦你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not trying to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.60,0:51:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.66,0:51:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是要跟你并肩作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're coming with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.71,0:52:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦？我不开心就吃 不行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I eat when I'm upset, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.48,0:52:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不必解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}No need to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.91,0:52:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为是金猴呢 他总把杏仁饼干藏在架子最上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you might be Monkey. He hides his almond cookies on the top shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.00,0:53:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟猴哥说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell Monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.77,0:53:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看看你 - 我知道 我让你看了恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look at you. - Yeah, I know, I disgust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.01,0:53:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是说 你是怎么爬上去的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean, how did you get up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.08,0:53:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不晓得 我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I guess that…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.18,0:53:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不晓得 我只是想着饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I was getting a cookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.55,0:53:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你就瞬间离地十尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet you are ten feet off the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.49,0:53:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还做出了完美的劈叉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have done a perfect spilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.89,0:53:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是啦 这只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this? This is just…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.59,0:53:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,误打误撞\N{\fnArial\fs30}…an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.17,0:53:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本就没有什么误打误撞\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no accidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.30,0:53:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.38,0:53:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你为教我武功 故弄玄虚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're trying to be all mystical and kung fuey…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.88,0:53:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也至少告诉我现在是去哪吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but could you at least tell me where we're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.53,0:54:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dragged me…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.10,0:54:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我累死累活爬上来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…all the way out here…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.83,0:54:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了让我洗白白？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for a bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.80,0:54:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,熊猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Panda…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.20,0:54:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这池神圣之泪可不是给你洗胳肢窝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we do not wash our pits in the Pool of Sacred Tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.08,0:54:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这池是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Pool of…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.18,0:54:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是乌龟大师参透禅机的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where Oogway unraveled the mysteries…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.85,0:54:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,两极调和 心无旁骛\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of harmony and focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.12,0:54:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是功夫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the birthplace…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.72,0:54:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,发源地\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of kung fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.97,0:54:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想学功夫吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to learn kung fu?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.30,0:54:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.37,0:54:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我就是你的师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I am your master!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.71,0:54:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.81,0:54:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.98,0:54:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.05,0:54:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你一心想着功夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you focus on kung fu,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.12,0:54:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要心无杂念\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you concentrate…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.36,0:55:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会搞臭\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you stink.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.86,0:55:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过那也许是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps that is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.83,0:55:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该一成不变 像教导「五侠」一样教导你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot train you the way I have trained the Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.36,0:55:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我明白了 要你学好武功\N{\fnArial\fs30}I now see that the way to get through to you…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.53,0:55:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得靠这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.90,0:55:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 太棒了 我快饿扁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great, 'cause I am hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.57,0:55:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.71,0:55:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你练完 就能吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you have been trained, you may eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.84,0:55:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.71,0:56:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先请\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you, panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.88,0:56:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么简单？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.92,0:56:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要仰卧起坐？不需要十里长跑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sit-ups? No ten-mile hike?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.65,0:56:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我起誓教你武功 你也学有所成 你可以尽情享用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I vowed to train you, and you have been trained. You are free to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.56,0:56:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,多吃点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.73,0:56:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.24,0:56:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了你可以尽情享用 来个饺子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said you are free to eat. Have a dumpling.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.71,0:56:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.45,0:57:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽情享用\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are free to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.48,0:57:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以吗！？- 你说呢？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Am I?! - Are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.77,0:58:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.91,0:58:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.24,0:59:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,砍断吊桥！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.76,0:59:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,「神龙大侠」怎么没来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the Dragon Warrior?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.63,0:59:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know you're not looking at her?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.70,0:59:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当我傻？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.97,0:59:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你根本就不是神龙大侠 你们五个都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're not the Dragon Warrior. None of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.67,0:59:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说了 他坐着火球从天而降\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard how he fell out of the sky in a ball of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.01,0:59:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他才是大侠 前无古人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he's a warrior unlike anything the world has ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.51,0:59:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿宝？- 那就是他的名字？阿宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Po? - So that is his name. Po.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.18,0:59:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于棋逢对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally, a worthy opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.35,1:00:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场对决将流传万世\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our battle will be legendary!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.84,1:00:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来拉住 你去帮她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got this. Help her.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.17,1:00:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,金猴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkey!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.24,1:00:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.14,1:00:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,想啥呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was I thinking?!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.75,1:01:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,螳螂！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mantis!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.02,1:01:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.37,1:01:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,师父把你们教得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shifu taught you well.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.64,1:02:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过并没倾囊相授\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he didn't teach you everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.68,1:02:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你表现不错 熊猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have done well, panda.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.25,1:02:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,表现不错？只是表现不错？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done well? Done well?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.02,1:02:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我表现彪悍！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done awesome!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.02,1:02:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,真英雄无不谦逊有加\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark of a true hero is humility.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.29,1:02:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,话虽这样说 你表现确实…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, yes, you have done…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.60,1:02:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,彪悍\N{\fnArial\fs30}…awesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.17,1:02:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们？是他们！他们死了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys? Guys?! They're dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.58,1:02:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 还有气 睡着了？眼睛睁着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they're breathing. They're asleep? No, their eyes are open.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.08,1:02:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们根本不是对手 都被点穴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were no match for his nerve attach.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.15,1:02:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他越来越强了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gotten stronger.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.45,1:02:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？大龙吗？更强了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who? Tai Lung? Stronger?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.95,1:02:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's too fast!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.02,1:02:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 阿宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Po.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.66,1:02:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我们能够阻止他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we could stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.29,1:02:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他本来可以杀了你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could have killed you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.20,1:02:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他为什么没呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.33,1:02:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你们活着回来引发恐惧 但这招不会得逞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you could come back and strike fear into our hearts. But it won't work.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.83,1:03:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这招可能有用… 有点用…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might. I mean, a little.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.17,1:03:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我真被吓到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.47,1:03:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以打败他的 熊猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can defeat him, panda!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.04,1:03:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说笑吧？连他们都不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding? If they can't?!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.04,1:03:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可是盖世「五」侠 我只是「一个」我而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're five masters. I'm just one me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.11,1:03:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 你拥有一样任何人都没有的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you will have the one thing that no one else does.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.82,1:03:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的相信我已经准备好了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really believe I'm ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.39,1:03:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.13,1:03:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Po.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.38,1:04:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,修习神龙卷轴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold the Dragon Scroll.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.01,1:04:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在它是你的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.02,1:04:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 如果我读了它的话会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What happens when I read it?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.02,1:04:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人知道 但据传说 你能听到蝴蝶振翅之声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legend says you will be able to hear a butterfly's wing beat.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.12,1:04:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？酷！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.43,1:04:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 能在至暗之洞中明察秋毫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. And see light in the deepest cave.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.33,1:04:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,能感应周身天地的一举一动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will feel the universe in motion around you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.90,1:04:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦！我能打穿墙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I punch through walls?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.40,1:04:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能连做四个后空翻吗？- 心无杂念\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do a quadruple back flip? - Focus.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.84,1:04:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能…？- 心无杂念\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will I…? - Focus.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.44,1:04:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 心无杂念 - 哦 好的 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Focus. - Oh, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.91,1:04:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿宝 读吧 完成你的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read it, Po, and fulfill your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.88,1:04:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,读吧 成为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read it and become…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.14,1:04:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,「神龙大侠」！\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the Dragon Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.79,1:04:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本打不开\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's impossible to open.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.19,1:05:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么紧，快开开吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. Come on, baby. Come on now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.66,1:05:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.36,1:05:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是我刚才已经弄松了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I probably loosened it up for you though.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.07,1:05:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我要看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.61,1:05:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么是空白 - 啥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's blank. - What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.35,1:05:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不信 你看 - 禁止旁人看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here, look. - No, I am forbidden to look upon…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.66,1:05:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真是空白 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blank. I don't…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.63,1:05:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.10,1:05:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 就是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. So, like…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.87,1:05:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌龟也不过就是只疯癫老龟\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Oogway was just a crazy old turtle after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.17,1:05:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 乌龟大师的智慧无人能及\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Oogway was wiser than us all.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.84,1:05:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 面对现实吧 他只不过是碰巧选上了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on! Face it he picked me by accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.98,1:05:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然不是什么「神龙大侠」 开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I'm not the Dragon Warrior. Who am I kidding?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.15,1:06:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,可谁来阻止大龙呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But who will stop Tai Lung?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.92,1:06:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会毁了一切 并杀了每个人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll destroy everything and everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.49,1:06:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.46,1:06:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,疏散整个山谷 你们必须保护村民们免受大龙的残暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evacuate the valley. You must protect the villagers from Tai Lung's rage.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.06,1:06:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那您怎么办呢 师父？- 我来迎战他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about you, Master? - I will fight him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.53,1:06:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我能拖多久就拖多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I can hold him off long enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.30,1:06:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样大家都能全身而退\N{\fnArial\fs30}for everyone to escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.83,1:06:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 师父 他会杀了你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Shifu, he'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.34,1:06:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就算我为过错付出的代价吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I will finally have paid for my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.14,1:06:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,都听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, all of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.31,1:06:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有我 你们也要继续走下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is time for you to continue yourjourney without me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.91,1:06:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,身为你们的师父 我十分自豪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am very proud to have been your master.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.70,1:06:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须让他们平安转移\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to get them out safely.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.14,1:06:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 小家伙 我们去找妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, little one. Let's find your mama.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.58,1:07:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵蛇 集合村子南边的人 螳螂 你去村北\N{\fnArial\fs30}Viper, gather the southern farmers. Mantis, the north.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.11,1:07:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,仙鹤 掌灯引路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orane, light the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.93,1:07:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 那就是「神龙大侠」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's the Dragon Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.68,1:07:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.68,1:07:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿宝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.89,1:07:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来就好 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to have you back, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.46,1:07:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来…就好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.03,1:07:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧 阿宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, Po.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.16,1:07:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来 我们该规划下一家面馆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So for our next shop it's time to face it…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.27,1:08:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,今后做面 菜要切成丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the future of noodles is dice-cut vegetables…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.10,1:08:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再切成丝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…no longer slices.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.27,1:08:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在想 趁着这次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, I was thinking, maybe this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.78,1:08:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们弄个大厨房 你就不用猫着腰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll have a kitchen you can actually stand up in.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.25,1:08:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.59,1:08:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿宝 我很遗憾 事不如愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po, I'm sorry if things didn't work out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.26,1:08:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你就没那个命\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just wasn't meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.77,1:08:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿宝 忘了这些不快吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po, forget everything else.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.34,1:08:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真正的命运还在等你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your destiny still awaits.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.60,1:08:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是面条世家 血管里流淌着面汤\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are noodle folk. Broth runs deep through our veins.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.48,1:08:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.81,1:08:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 有时我甚至不相信我是你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, sometimes I can't believe I'm actually your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.19,1:08:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.35,1:08:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是时候告诉你 一些很久以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I think it's time I told you something I should have told you…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.86,1:08:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就该告诉你的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.99,1:08:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.10,1:09:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那秘之又秘私酿密汤的配方…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The secret ingredient of my Secret Ingredient Soup.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.97,1:09:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,…靠近点…秘之又秘的配方就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. The secret ingredient is…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.67,1:09:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥都没\N{\fnArial\fs30}…nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.14,1:09:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了么 啥都没！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard me. Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.65,1:09:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本就没什么秘之又秘的配方！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no secret ingredient!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.18,1:09:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 一切只不过是普通的面汤？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait. It's just plain old noodle soup?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.32,1:09:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没加什么秘方酱汁 或者其他什么特别的东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't add some kind of special sauce or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.26,1:09:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没那必要 想让一件东西特别 你只要相信那是特别的就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't have to. To make something special, you just believe it's special.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.34,1:09:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没有秘方\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no secret ingredient.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.43,1:10:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回家来了 师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have come home, Master.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.30,1:10:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不再是你家 我也不再是你师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is no longer your home. And I am no longer your master.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.63,1:10:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你已经另有新宠了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes. You have a new favorite.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.64,1:10:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 阿宝人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where is this Po?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.18,1:10:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把他吓跑了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I scare him off?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.48,1:10:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你我之间的战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This battle is between you and me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.22,1:10:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 就如你所言吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that is how it's going to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.72,1:10:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须如我所言\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is how it must be.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.90,1:10:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在大牢里蹲了20年 就因为你的懦弱！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rotted in jail for 20 years because of your weakness!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.54,1:10:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊从师命 怎叫软弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obeying your master is not weakness!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.98,1:10:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你原本知道的 我才是「神龙大侠」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew I was the Dragon Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.84,1:10:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always knew.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.08,1:11:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是当乌龟说「非也」 你做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when Oogway said otherwise what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.15,1:11:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.22,1:11:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没做！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.43,1:11:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你命中注定不是神龙大侠 那不是我的错！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were not meant to be the Dragon Warrior! That was not my fault!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.33,1:11:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你的错？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not your fault?!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.36,1:11:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁让我满怀梦想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who filled my head with dreams?!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.50,1:11:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁逼我练功练到骨错筋伤？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who drove me to train until my bones cracked?!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.80,1:11:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是谁害我当不成神龙大侠？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who denied me my destiny?!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.78,1:11:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那件事并非我能决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was never my decision to make!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.86,1:11:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你能了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.23,1:11:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,给-我-卷-轴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the scroll!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.07,1:11:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁可死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would rather die.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.45,1:12:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做的一切都是为了让你骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I ever did, I did to make you proud!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.72,1:12:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你有多骄傲 师父！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me how proud you are, Shifu!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.19,1:12:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.23,1:12:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.27,1:13:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我一直都为你骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have… I have always been proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.78,1:13:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,从一开始 我就\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the first moment, I've been…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.18,1:13:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}…proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.55,1:13:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是这种骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it was my pride…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.98,1:13:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙蔽了我双眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that blinded me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.09,1:13:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你的溺爱 让我看不到你的变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved you too much to see what you were becoming…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.66,1:13:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…what I…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.99,1:13:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才变成这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…was turning you into.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.80,1:13:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.83,1:13:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.34,1:13:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要你的道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want your apology.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.14,1:13:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要卷轴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want my scroll!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.78,1:13:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.18,1:13:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,卷轴去哪了？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.42,1:13:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,神龙大侠早已带着神龙卷轴远走高飞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dragon Warrior has taken the scroll halfway across China by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.16,1:13:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远见不到那卷轴了 大龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will never see that scroll, Tai Lung.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.36,1:13:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.63,1:14:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.57,1:14:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,台阶太多了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.31,1:14:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.18,1:14:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 我就是「神龙大侠」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy, I am the Dragon Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.22,1:14:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.52,1:14:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他？一只熊猫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him? He's a panda.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.56,1:14:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是只熊猫 你想怎么着，大家伙？一屁股坐死我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a panda. What are you gonna do, big guy? Sit on me?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.49,1:14:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把我惹毛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tempt me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.49,1:14:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我可要用这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now. I'm gonna use this.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.60,1:14:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要吗？来拿啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want it? Come and get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.97,1:14:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于到手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.23,1:15:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个卷轴是我的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That scroll is mine!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.45,1:16:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快如闪电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lightning!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.69,1:16:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,卷轴给了他力量！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The scroll has given him power!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.32,1:16:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.36,1:17:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于到手了 哦 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally! Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.37,1:17:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,神龙卷轴的力量 是我的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power of the Dragon Scroll is mine!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.54,1:17:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么是空的？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.54,1:17:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我第一次也没看出个所以然来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK. I didn't get it the first time, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.91,1:17:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.18,1:17:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没有秘方\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no secret ingredient.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.52,1:17:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键就在自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.53,1:17:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.67,1:18:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都想尿尿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna pee.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.00,1:18:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别戳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.71,1:18:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别… 别戳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.64,1:19:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.51,1:19:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能打败我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…can't defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.18,1:19:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.75,1:19:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不过是只又肥…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you're just a big…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.62,1:19:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,…又胖的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…fat…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.29,1:19:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,熊猫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}…panda!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.26,1:19:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是什么又肥又胖的熊猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a big fat panda.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.46,1:19:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是独一无二的又肥又胖的熊猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the big fat panda.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.03,1:19:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫师指？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The WuXi Finger Hold!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.53,1:19:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你知道这招啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you know this hold?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.04,1:19:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你唬我 你在唬我 师父不会教你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bluffing. You're bluffing. Shifu didn't teach you that.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.07,1:19:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.84,1:19:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无师自通\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured it out. Skadoosh.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.56,1:20:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.83,1:20:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是「神龙大侠」\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dragon Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.40,1:20:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个可爱的大块头功夫大侠 就是我儿子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my boy! That big lovely kung fu warrior is my son!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.34,1:20:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.71,1:20:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.55,1:21:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.69,1:21:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.09,1:21:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.43,1:21:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.26,1:21:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,师父大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Shifu!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.78,1:21:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.21,1:21:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,师父 你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shifu, are you OK?!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.68,1:21:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Po.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.15,1:21:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.15,1:21:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是咱俩都死了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we're both dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.46,1:21:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 师父 我没死 我打败了大龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Master, I didn't die. I defeated Tai Lung.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.46,1:21:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.86,1:21:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇噢 正如乌龟所说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. It is as Oogway foretold.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.67,1:21:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是「神龙大侠」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the Dragon Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.91,1:22:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把平和\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have brought peace…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.44,1:22:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,带给这个山谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to this valley…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.28,1:22:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,也…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.55,1:22:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,也带给了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.25,1:22:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.35,1:22:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 阿宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Po.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.66,1:22:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢… 谢谢…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.77,1:22:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 师父 别死啊！！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Master! No, no, no don't die, Shifu, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.84,1:22:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没死 你个白痴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not dying, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.64,1:22:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 「神龙大侠」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Dragon Warrior…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.88,1:22:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在享受平和 终于平和了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I am simply at peace. Finally.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.45,1:22:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 那我应该闭嘴？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I should stop talking?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.09,1:22:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好是\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.81,1:23:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要…吃点啥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to get something to eat?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.08,1:23:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.19,1:23:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 人人都爱比试武艺 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Everybody is kung fu fighting ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.42,1:23:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你的思想闪电难及 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Your mind becomes fast as lightning ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.76,1:23:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 尽管前路有些恐惧 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Although the future is a little bit frightening ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.26,1:23:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你仍书写你的传奇 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It's the book of your life that you're writing ∮
