Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.12,1:23:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你仍书写你的传奇 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It's the book of your life that you're writing ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.96,1:23:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你有如此高的天赋 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You are a natural ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.23,1:23:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但又为何不为人知 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Why is that so hard to see? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.56,1:24:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 或许太过在乎自己 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Maybe it's just because You keep on looking at me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.73,1:24:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 孤身之路远超想像 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The journey's a lonely one So much more than we know ∮
